{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id110301653"}, "name":{"label":"Pinstrypsoldier"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-07-03T10:30:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.6.1"}, "id":{"label":"2829230978"}, "title":{"label":"Very cool"}, "content":{"label":"Very rarely leave reviews unless I’m seriously disappointed or seriously impressed. This is a very clean app. Love how easy it is to set tasks, edit tasks etc. You genuinely cant forgetting anything because the tasks don’t stop alarming. By that I mean, when you swipe the notification away because now’s not a good time, normally that would be it for other apps and you forget. But with this app you’re just ‘snoozing’ the reminder. It’ll remind you again, and again, and again until you say it’s done or you change the due date/time (though the snooze time is editable). \nMy only criticism would be that it would be nice to have other colour themes to pick from because grey looks a bit drab and the only other option is white, but seriously - well done. Love this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"9"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"21"}}, 
