{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id338802290"}, "name":{"label":"pazzle-lazzle"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-05-07T06:16:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.6.1"}, "id":{"label":"2516145592"}, "title":{"label":"Life-changing"}, "content":{"label":"07/05/2018 - No issues so far. \nThis app is so easy to use. Don’t usually write reviews but this is the best app I’ve ever had and I wish I had it 20 years ago. My life would be so different. \nI’m a serial procrastinator with ADD and forget everything so other reminder apps don’t work for me. \nP.S. Remember to take your headphones out of your iPhone and turn the buzzer on. I’ve added a reminder just for this!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id204146711"}, "name":{"label":"Promasidor Group ICT"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-03-21T14:04:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.6.1"}, "id":{"label":"2331392014"}, "title":{"label":"Super cool"}, "content":{"label":"Works! Yeah, didn't find folders or categories to group reminders like you could do with Apple reminders App. But, it syncs perfectly well across devices (unlike the Applr one!), is easy, simpler and leaner to use than others like Wunderlist but at the same time more powerful when it comes to reminders (recurring etc).\nNot saying it's perfect, there's always a few things here and there you'd like differently or more but definitively NO regrets, am adopting it!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
