{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id39966682"}, "name":{"label":"MamaMicah"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-22T22:43:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"1654256624"}, "title":{"label":"Simple but effective"}, "content":{"label":"This is a great little app that does exactly what it needs to-you can easily set reminders, months or years ahead, set them to repeat in a number of different formats. My only criticism, which is a fairly big one, is that when you swipe to clear a reminder, it is very easy to swipe and delete it-thereby removing any repeats of set. Remove this and it's great.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id432784383"}, "name":{"label":"Rob from Somerset"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-08T07:16:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"1608537641"}, "title":{"label":"A well put together app that now has a major flaw"}, "content":{"label":"This really was an excellent app and still has great uses. The reason I originally biught it was the indefinite , reliable repeating reminders. The reminders are no longer reliable and it doesn't do the job it used to for me. I'm sure it still might work well for others!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
