{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id205716137"}, "name":{"label":"EssexPenguin1980"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-02-25T23:34:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.4.2"}, "id":{"label":"1552843685"}, "title":{"label":"I only write reviews when deserving"}, "content":{"label":"Very rarely write any reviews of apps but on this occasion I decided that I genuinely needed to say how brilliant this one is. Had been looking for an upgrade over the iOS reminder app and for something more reliable than octovilles reminder. Searched around a lot of other review sites to try and find something and failed miserably. At the moment this app does not seem to feature that often or that highly in lists of reminder apps but please, please don't let that put you off. I use this constantly every day. Extremely reliable. Love that you can customise the screen to create reminders, with fast links to times that you regularly schedule reminders for. Constant nags can be set at whatever interval required. Snooze is customisable as well. In my opinion the best reminder app on iOS at the moment. Worth every penny.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=390017969&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
